# EZBill API — env documentation
#
# ⚠️ This app does NOT need its own .env file.
# All runtime config comes from the ROOT monorepo file:
#   @ezstart/.env.local / .env.staging / .env.production
#
# See /SECRETS.md for the canonical architecture.
#
# Variables consumed by this API (from root):
#   - MONGO_URL                  → used via getMongoUrl('ezbill')
#   - JWT_SECRET                 → used via getJwtSecret()
#   - EXCHANGE_RATE_API_KEY      → external FX rates
#   - GEMINI_API_KEY             → optional, AI invoice helpers
#   - RESEND_API_KEY             → transactional email sender
#   - RUN_EXCHANGE_RATES_ON_START → cron flag
#   - SENTRY_DSN_EZBILL          → resolved via getSentryDsn('ezbill')
